  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An exchange project between Norway and Vietnam that uses internationalization as a way to develop vocational skills to make students more attractive to employers. Vocational students and teachers from hospitality, service and transportation, restaurant and food processing programs will get to develop the vocational skills within their diciplines. Students will get the opportunity to get a comprehensive understanding of their field of expertise in a global sense. Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
